<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
html { background: #ffffff; }
body {
  width: 720pt; height: 405pt; margin: 0; padding: 0;
  background: #F4F6F6;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  display: flex;
}
.header {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
  height: 70pt;
  background: #1C2833;
  padding: 20pt 40pt;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.header h1 {
  font-size: 28pt;
  color: #F4F6F6;
  margin: 0;
}
.content {
  margin: 90pt 40pt 30pt 40pt;
}
h2 {
  font-size: 24pt;
  color: #D4AF37;
  margin: 0 0 20pt 0;
  font-weight: bold;
}
.strategy-box {
  background: #ffffff;
  border-left: 8pt solid #D4AF37;
  padding: 20pt;
  margin-bottom: 20pt;
  border-radius: 4pt;
}
.strategy-box h3 {
  font-size: 18pt;
  color: #1C2833;
  margin: 0 0 8pt 0;
  font-weight: bold;
}
.strategy-box p {
  font-size: 15pt;
  color: #2E4053;
  margin: 0;
  line-height: 1.5;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header">
  <h1>总结：稳中求进，步步为营</h1>
</div>
<div class="content">
  <h2>三种投资策略建议</h2>

  <div class="strategy-box">
    <h3>激进型</h3>
    <p>侧重 AI 科技与成长股</p>
  </div>

  <div class="strategy-box">
    <h3>稳健型</h3>
    <p>均衡配置 黄金 + 红利 + 科技</p>
  </div>

  <div class="strategy-box">
    <h3>保守型</h3>
    <p>高配红利资产与债券</p>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
